I will watch a Grey's Anatomy episode,

00:09:23.940 --> 00:09:25.930
or whatever show you
guys want me to watch,

00:09:25.930 --> 00:09:27.170
leave it down below in the comments.

00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:28.880
Not only will I watch that episode,

00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:31.450
I will film myself watching the episode,

